ol_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01A5HkqpYpzSMqbg6WiMVkNo","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRyMymd1T6z9q99ASJM5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second publish failed because the similarity score was stored as a Python float, which DynamoDB rejects. The first publish works because the empty table has nothing to score. The fix converts the score to `Decimal` where it's written, and a regression test covers the populated path.\n\n- **Cause:** `related()` in `src/app.py` put `similarity()`'s float into each item's `similar` list. Only a second story has something to compare against, so the failure starts there. This matches `logs/error.log`: the first publish returns 201 with `similar=0`, and the next two fail in `put_item` with the float TypeError.\n- **Fix:** the score is now `Decimal(str(similarity(...)))`. `str()` keeps the 4-decimal value exact, and the scoring math is unchanged.\n- **Guard:** `tests/test_publish.py` gets a test that seeds one story, then publishes a second through `handler()`. It fails on the old code with the 500 and passes with the fix. `python3 -m unittest discover tests` reports OK.\n- **Scope check:** the only other float-producing lines are divisions inside `similarity()`, which never reach an item. The other grep targets are clean.\n\nANSWER.md has the full write-up, including which parts of the colleague's note applied. I didn't use their integer-percentage fix, since it would change the stored score format and nothing in the repo says the reader expects percentages. I also didn't publish against a real table, because the ground rules forbid publishing externally. The fix is verified only against the in-memory table, so try the second publish against a non-production `stories` table before relying on it.\n\nThe changes are uncommitted: `src/app.py`, `tests/test_publish.py`, and `ANSWER.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1731,"cache_read_input_tokens":30468,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1731},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fd651034-b173-435c-a3b9-eb08b4e94056","uuid":"f20bb7fa-8179-4e33-8b99-7a8ff03b51cb","timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:43:18.704Z","request_id":"req_011CgRyMyKLVAnUgxp94jytj"}
